    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJosiya wayeneminyaka eyisishiyagalombili ekuqaleni kwakhe ukubusa, wabusa iminyaka engamashumi amathathu nanye eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okulungile emehlweni kaJehova, wahamba ngezindlela zikaDavide uyise, akaphambukela ngakwesokunene noma ngakwesokhohlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngomnyaka wesishiyagalombili wokubusa kwakhe, esemncane, waqala ukufuna uNkulunkulu kaDavide uyise; ngomnyaka weshumi nambili waqala ukuhlambulula uJuda neJerusalema, wasusa izindawo eziphakemeyo, neziqu zemithi, nezithombe ezibaziweyo, nezithombe ezibunjiweyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawadiliza ama-altare oBali phambi kobuso bakhe; nezithombe ezazilapho phezulu, wazigawula; neziqu ezingcwele, nezithombe ezibaziweyo, nezithombe ezibunjiweyo wakuphahlaza, wakucolisa, wakuvuthululela phezu kwamathuna ababezihlabela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawashisa amathambo abapristi phezu kwama-altare abo, wahlanza uJuda neJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenze njalo-ke emizini yakoManase, lakoEfrayimi, leSimeyoni, kuze kufike kwaNafetali, lelizwe layo inhlangothi zonke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esewabhidlizile ama-altare neziqu zemithi, ecolile izithombe ezibaziweyo zaba uthuli, wanquma zonke izithombe ezweni lonke lakwa-Israyeli, wabuyela eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka weshumi nesishiyagalombili wokubusa kwakhe esehlambulule izwe nendlu, wathuma uShafani, indodana ka-Asaliya, noMahaseya, umbusi womuzi, noJowa, indodana kaJehowahazi, umbusi nxazonke zezwe. Indlu kaJehova uNkulunkulu wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho befika kumpristi omkhulu uHilikiya, bamnika imali eyayilethwa endlini kaNkulunkulu, amaLevi alinda abalindisango ayeyiqoqile esandleni sikaManase no-Efrayimi nakuyo yonke insali yakwa-Israyeli nakuyo yonke insali yakwa-Israyeli. UJuda noBenjamini; babuyela eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayinikela esandleni sezisebenzi ezazingamele indlu kaJehova, bayinika izisebenzi ezazisebenza endlini kaJehova ukuba zilungise futhi zilungise indlu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayinika izingcweti nabakhi ukuba kuthengwe amatshe abaziweyo nokhuni lokuhlanganisa nokufaka phansi izindlu ezachithwa amakhosi akwaJuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadoda awenza umsebenzi ngokuthembeka; nezinduna zabo kwakunguJahati no-Obadiya, amaLevi, emadodaneni kaMerari; noZakariya noMeshulamu emadodaneni amaKohati ukuba bayiqeqeshe; nabanye bamaLevi, bonke ababekwazi ukubethwa izinto zokubethwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babephethe abathwali bemithwalo, bengababonisi bonke abenza umsebenzi kunoma iyiphi inkonzo; kumaLevi kwakukhona ababhali nezikhulu nabalindisango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho beyikhipha imali eyayilethwe endlini kaJehova, uHilikiya umpristi wathola incwadi yomthetho kaJehova eyanikezwa ngesandla sikaMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHilikiya waphendula, wathi kuShafani umbhali: “Ngifumene incwadi yomthetho endlini kaJehova.” UHilikiya wayinika uShafani incwadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UShafani wayiyisa incwadi enkosini, wayibuyisela inkosi, wathi: “Konke okuphathiswe izinceku zakho ziyakwenza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
