            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base beyiqoqa imali eyatholwa endlini kaJehova, bayinikela esandleni sababonisi nasesandleni sezisebenzi.",
