              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yabayala oHilikiya, no-Ahikamu, indodana kaShafani, no-Abidoni, indodana kaMika, noShafani umbhali, no-Asaya inceku yenkosi, yathi:",
